This is a compatibility-only repackaging of GNU binutils 2.41.  It
builds and installs only the private runtime libraries libopcodes,
libbfd and libsframe; it does not build or install the binutils
programs or development files.

The package was put together from the Debian binutils source package,
which was originally prepackaged by James Troup <james@nocrew.org>
from sources obtained from:

  https://ftp.gnu.org/pub/gnu/binutils/

